@baseUrl = http://localhost:5189

### 1. List all products (expect 200, sorted by name)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

> {%
    client.global.set("productId", response.body[0].id);
%}

### 2. Existing product (expect 200). Run request 1 first to set productId.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{productId}}
Accept: application/json

### 3. Unknown Guid (expect 404 with a ProblemDetails body)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### 4. Not a Guid (expect 404 with an empty body: the :guid route constraint doesn't match)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/abc
Accept: application/json
